  "user_request_original": "Optimize a 24-layer alternating HfO2/SiO2 (Lemarchand) dielectric stack on fused silica substrate with air incident medium. Layers alternate starting with HfO2 at the air interface. Optimize only 7 layer thicknesses: layer 0 (HfO2), layer 1 (SiO2 (Lemarchand)), layer 4 (HfO2), layer 5 (SiO2 (Lemarchand)), layer 13 (HfO2), layer 14 (SiO2 (Lemarchand)), layer 15 (HfO2). Fix remaining 17 layers at their thickness values from the best candidate in iteration 13 (candidate hfo2_SiO2 (Lemarchand)_24layer_dual_band_opt__g__ebbcd37d44b7). Wavelength bands: maximize transmittance at 1530-1565 nm, maximize reflectance at 400-700 nm. Normal incidence. Use gradient-based thickness optimizer with step size reduced to 0.0125 (half of previous 0.025). Thickness bounds for variable layers: 40-150 nm. Evaluate coherent transfer matrix method. Report best_target_score, valid_candidates, tightest_margin, and thicknesses_nm for all candidates.",
  "normalized_request_english": "Optimize a 24-layer alternating HfO2/SiO2 dielectric stack on fused silica with air incidence. Vary seven specified layer thicknesses between 40 and 150 nm to maximize transmittance in the 1530–1565 nm band and maximize reflectance in the 400–700 nm band at normal incidence using coherent TMM and an adaptive LBFGS optimizer with a 0.0125 learning rate.",
